<title>UK: UK notes in circulation rise 7.7 pct.</title>
<headline>UK notes in circulation rise 7.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>British bank notes in circulation rose 7.7 percent in the week to October 9 over the equivalent year-ago week, data released by the Bank of England showed. Last week the annual rise was 8.0 percent.</p>
<p>NOTES IN CIRCULATION (in rounded bln stg) -</p>
<p>				Latest week  pvs week</p>
<p> Notes in circulation     20.77	  20.87</p>
<p> Bankers' deposits	  1.85	   1.84</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
